      "post_id": "42336",
      "author_handle": "jrich83",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 18 years 8 months ago",
      "body": "I tried the medala min electric breast pump to work good.\ni actually bought one but ended up using my friends if you decide you'd like that one i will sell you mine i paid £60 for it. its unopened i will sell it for £30.\ni did found that it was quicker to use the electric pump but it did take a whilwe for me to get uster to it. i resorted to a manual pump more often than not.\nHope that helps",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-4091/#42336",
