      "author_handle": "NorthcoastLS",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 9 years 7 months ago",
      "body": "Hi! I'm an International Board Certified Lactation Consultant (IBCLC) and I recommend the Medela Pump in Style (double electric pump) and the Spectra S2 (double electric pump) which both have great reviews. Hope this helps! Good Luck!",
