      "author_handle": "lizedmonds1",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 9 years 5 months ago",
      "body": "By far the best breast pump is the medela and if you can afford the double pump rent or buy this.\nThere is a good website that provides info about breast pumps and other useful breastfeeding info called babyconfused.com/breastfeeding.",
