    {
      "post_id": "90668",
      "author_handle": "neana",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 8 years 6 months ago",
      "body": "Hi,\nI also used the Melea breast pump and I was quite happy about it. However when our LO was about five months old I started going back to work and it was very exhausting for me. Being a mother, breast feeding, pumping milk, working, running errands etc. so my husband and I decided on trying to use formula in addition so he could help me with the feeding part. After searching for a decent formula\nwe decided to give Holle from myorganicformula.com\na try. I was really happy once when I could quit at least the pumping part.\nAnyways pumping with the Melea was quite easy and I'd suggest it further.\nBest,\nNeana",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-4091/#90668",
